  "body": "Quick hotfixes for the following windows desktop bugs:\r\n- Double Windows title bar showing\r\n- temp log files growth\r\n\r\nFor all those interested in the big 3.0.0 release and all the cool features we added, check out here \r\nhttps://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases#release-v3.0.0\r\n\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Bug Fixes\r\n* fix(jpdfium): stop the backend gracefully and reclaim extraction dirs by @balazs-szucs in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8202\r\n### Enhancements\r\n* Unify tool list and viewer bar icon colours; rename right sidebar header to PDF Tools by @reecebrowne in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8190\r\n* Fix double title bar on Windows desktop after upgrade by @Frooodle in https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/pull/8203\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/compare/v3.0.0...v3.0.1",
